                "description": "The Windsor Knob with Small Palladian Plate features a beautiful egg-shaped knob that is perfect for historic homes. The Elegant Windsor Knob with Palladian Interior Plate has a style that is breathtaking. Select from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. It will fit most pre-drilled doors.",
